{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, players will take on the role of a beggar and earn in-game currency by clicking on the game interface with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can use the in-game currency to upgrade their character's level, thereby changing their identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, players can use the currency to unlock spouses and other functions that can be used to obtain more currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moreover, there are other mini-games in the game to get a large amount of currency, but they require the player's character to reach a certain level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a check-in system, an online reward system, and an auto-click system, which allows players to free their hands and have a pleasant gaming experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904160?t=1753859614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904160/e92f5e8b47da76b7784c858d5e4994a2f02bcd53/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753859614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904160/b58ae831f7a8daa2857ed6b87c0615bcb3913f81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753859614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904160/b58ae831f7a8daa2857ed6b87c0615bcb3913f81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753859614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, players will take on the role of a beggar and earn in-game currency by clicking on the game interface with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can use the in-game currency to upgrade their character's level, thereby changing their identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, players can use the currency to unlock spouses and other functions that can be used to obtain more currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moreover, there are other mini-games in the game to get a large amount of currency, but they require the player's character to reach a certain level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a check-in system, an online reward system, and an auto-click system, which allows players to free their hands and have a pleasant gaming experience.</p>","developers":["\u8840\u6218\u6c99\u57ce\u00b7\u738b\u8005\u5f52\u6765"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904160/d4d1e0679d59fa7bd43fde8d823c4025f25fd1e2/header.jpg?t=1753859614","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173240,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173240/movie480.mp4?t=1753666583","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173240/movie_max.mp4?t=1753666583"},"name":"\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173240/7d15157bb112c567bd4640470616410c1c169e49/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753666583","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173240/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753666583","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173240/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753666583"}}],"name":"\u8840\u6218\u6c99\u57ce\u00b7\u738b\u8005\u5f52\u6765","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommen